@anon.9bf146a73cb71d9c7e3fe69f46c42f4a.712 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [388 x i8] }> <{ [388 x i8] c"The caption's position in the figure. Either `{top}` or `{bottom}`.\0A\0A```example\0A#show figure.where(\0A  kind: table\0A): set figure.caption(position: top)\0A\0A#figure(\0A  table(columns: 2)[A][B],\0A  caption: [I'm up here],\0A)\0A\0A#figure(\0A  rect[Hi],\0A  caption: [I'm down here],\0A)\0A\0A#figure(\0A  table(columns: 2)[A][B],\0A  caption: figure.caption(\0A    position: bottom,\0A    [I'm down here too!]\0A  )\0A)\0A```" }>, align 1
